{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"t":"Test 3","w":0.052071981430053704,"y":0.059377758214809728,"c":1,"h":0.01496541374959337,"x":0.086420756603622029},{"w":0.15224913279215496,"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1,"t":"Questions 27-30","x":0.086505191303902176,"y":0.10741777498497551},{"t":"Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.","y":0.14378359677587194,"w":0.32548624674479165,"h":0.020856047110427434,"c":1,"x":0.086380589275577263},{"x":0.086389066292734407,"y":0.17892157524010088,"w":0.50715586344401031,"h":0.021131092389202188,"t":"Write the correct letter in boxes 27-30 on your answer sheet.","c":1},{"t":"27 What is the writer doing in the second paragraph?","w":0.4567473856608073,"y":0.21798460469291236,"x":0.084775096010426793,"h":0.017494751574527623,"c":1},{"w":0.54162902832031246,"h":0.0201682296977167,"t":"pinpointing some key changes in our understanding of prehistory","y":0.24439512226948235,"c":1,"x":0.16431462467348334},{"x":0.16435985885872686,"w":0.57612457275390627,"y":0.26452064372611961,"h":0.017494751574527623,"c":1,"t":"outlining some aspects of prehistory which are still poorly understood"},{"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"y":0.28343023260054301,"t":"C","x":0.12456747442117537,"w":0.013840829531351725},{"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"t":"D","y":0.30087209303840634,"w":0.015570934613545737,"x":0.12456747376877501},{"t":"summarising some attitudes towards recent archaeological revelations","x":0.16262975676748226,"w":0.58304499308268232,"h":0.018932983206234488,"c":1,"y":0.28197674398089523},{"c":1,"w":0.60735804239908853,"h":0.019465942329422781,"x":0.16258727178896862,"t":"giving an overview of some current disagreements among archaeologists","y":0.3004040037855632},{"y":0.33720930235380175,"t":"28 In the sixth paragraph, the writer mentions mobile phones to make the point that","c":1,"w":0.71626296997070316,"h":0.018983839607639164,"x":0.083044985497011697},{"c":1,"t":"most developments happen in a gradual way.","h":0.021302161139988174,"y":0.36331411356139665,"x":0.16423030867896007,"w":0.37921168009440109},{"h":0.017608671275112897,"y":0.38372092994840146,"c":1,"x":0.15397924450255157,"w":0.39792386372884109,"t":"innovation can come from a variety of sources."},{"c":1,"w":0.013840829531351725,"t":"C","x":0.12456747442117534,"y":0.40261627908491793,"h":0.013081395100512871},{"y":0.42005813982410256,"x":0.12456747378319255,"h":0.014534882851794828,"c":1,"t":"D","w":0.015570934613545723},{"h":0.017607654200474498,"y":0.40261627878571382,"c":1,"t":"not all technological advancements are positive.","w":0.40657440185546867,"x":0.1591695463929301},{"x":0.16089966033689287,"y":0.42005813924729152,"w":0.41349479675292977,"t":"the path of evolution can often be unpredictable.","h":0.017441861023846039,"c":1},{"h":0.022732244161895454,"t":"29 In the seventh paragraph, the phrase 'unpick this stuff' refers to the task of","y":0.45363382523982287,"c":1,"x":0.082975738864551785,"w":0.66106267293294263},{"t":"assessing the impact of certain recent research findings.","x":0.16262976762557349,"w":0.46539789835611978,"y":0.48390482885845243,"c":1,"h":0.019002147618501275},{"t":"B","x":0.12456747442117534,"y":0.50436046513142962,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"w":0.013840829531351725},{"t":"C","w":0.013840829531351725,"h":0.014534882851794828,"c":1,"y":0.5218023258948391,"x":0.12456747442117534},{"y":0.53924418633573046,"t":"D","x":0.12456747378319255,"w":0.015570934613545723,"h":0.014534882851794939,"c":1},{"y":0.50153588166810292,"x":0.16253985248043193,"t":"questioning the authenticity of evidence used in earlier research.","h":0.021366650612726246,"c":1,"w":0.53822072347005212},{"w":0.55536331176757814,"t":"conducting research into how prehistoric societies were organised.","x":0.16262976271921056,"y":0.52169349194922243,"h":0.019004182435149897,"c":1},{"t":"reevaluating research influenced by outdated beliefs about society.","y":0.53918824363085993,"x":0.16262974876083347,"h":0.0189512912170966,"w":0.55882354736328121,"c":1},{"y":0.57697690684714897,"w":0.47750864664713533,"x":0.084775088354318434,"h":0.017499837615091218,"t":"30 What does the writer suggest in the final paragraph?","c":1},{"w":0.58823527018229171,"x":0.12283738209221719,"h":0.017494751574527623,"t":"A Studying past societies could help us create a fairer society today.","c":1,"y":0.60461861411725937},{"y":0.62164362795596628,"h":0.020839044478825564,"c":1,"x":0.16256270032907943,"w":0.59702880859375007,"t":"We should not judge past societies by the standards of modern society."},{"w":0.015570934613545723,"c":1,"h":0.01308139510051276,"y":0.64244186049583996,"t":"C","x":0.12283736997696418},{"y":0.65988372124367622,"w":0.017301038106282543,"h":0.014534882851794939,"x":0.12456747391110325,"t":"D","c":1},{"w":0.61789672851562494,"h":0.021135318187502805,"c":1,"x":0.16252035334466561,"t":"We still have much to learn about how societies have evolved over history.","y":0.63886852754735812},{"c":1,"w":0.57093424479166666,"y":0.65988372064810774,"t":"There is more than one way to interpret evidence about societies in","x":0.15224914049398744,"h":0.017513060252761559},{"w":0.14532872517903647,"h":0.01611246238478925,"c":1,"y":0.67877906982727831,"t":"prehistoric times.","x":0.16435985876380735},{"x":0.084775087497673804,"y":0.7136627907658708,"c":1,"t":"Questions 31-34","h":0.015988371937820545,"w":0.15224913279215496},{"w":0.51384084065755209,"h":0.01901537092354344,"x":0.084775081309861708,"c":1,"t":"Complete each sentence with the correct ending, A-F, below.","y":0.75145348839974735},{"h":0.019067245066958449,"t":"Write the correct letter, A-F, in boxes 31-34 on your answer sheet.","x":0.086505178076015404,"w":0.55017303466796874,"c":1,"y":0.78779069770228871},{"t":"31 The findings at Kalambo Falls revealed that","y":0.8222445600335706,"h":0.020692490296734256,"x":0.082946857134553326,"w":0.39984362284342445,"c":1},{"y":0.86039188261803812,"t":"32 Evidence from high-altitude regions suggests that","x":0.083044986480906052,"